<title>UK: Abbey National falls after switch advice.</title>
<headline>Abbey National falls after switch advice.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in retail banking group Abbey National Plc slipped on Monday ahead of Tuesday's trading statement as ABN AMRO Hoare Govett advised switching into National Westminster Bank.</p>
<p>Abbey shares retreated 6-1/2p to 603p, while NatWest added 10p to 719p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
